    "image_with_text_kK4AKq": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_Jx6kqb": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Industries We Support"
          }
        },
        "heading_DMkPBE": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Various Tapes and Films Used in the Automotive Industry",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_BqiPHj": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Adhesive tapes used in automotive production are distinctly different from other industrial tapes, and they must be able to withstand a variety of stresses to meet specialized needs. Common types of automotive tapes include:</p><ul><li>Mounting foam tapes</li><li>Automotive masking tape</li><li>Double-side tapes</li><li>Temporary protection tape</li></ul><p>At NADCO, our die-cutting and converting capabilities allow us to create fully customized automotive tape and label solutions. With our knowledgeable team and high-quality tools, we can create the best possible solution for your needs. Depending on your requirements, we can die-cut automotive tapes in various shapes and sizes as well as add creases, perforations, and more.</p><p>We can work with a wide range of materials, regardless of the type of adhesive used. Materials we work with include fabrics, single and <a href=\"https://shopnadco.com/collections/double-coated-foam-tape\" title=\"https://shopnadco.com/collections/double-coated-foam-tape\">double-sided foam tape</a>, foils, paper, rubber, vinyl and more. Whether you need strong adhesive tapes for mounting automotive components or dealership decals, we can work with you to create the best possible die-cut products.</p>",
            "subtext_color": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "subheading_Jx6kqb",
        "heading_DMkPBE",
        "text_BqiPHj"
      ],
      "custom_css": [],
      "name": "t:sections.image-with-text.name",
      "settings": {
        "container": "fixed",
        "color_scheme": "",
